  "releaseNotes": "Fixed wrong-schema and unbounded-cache bugs for specs without operationId; malformed JSON bodies and content-based parameters are now violations instead of passing silently or crashing; added MaxRequestBufferSizeBytes with a bounded, cancellation-aware request read; options validated fail-fast at host start; OnViolation observer exceptions are isolated; wrapped contract-file IO errors; 64-bit integer response headers no longer false-violate; CI gains vulnerability audit, coverage reporting, and format checks.",
